{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a turn-based strategy game that combines dice and card mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a fantasy world filled with spirits and magic, you play as a bounty hunter\u2026 looking to buy a house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631830/extras/f4b71910a6676b42edf1c144f1f39227.poster.avif?t=1760349284\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631830/extras/f4b71910a6676b42edf1c144f1f39227.webm?t=1760349284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631830/extras/f4b71910a6676b42edf1c144f1f39227.mp4?t=1760349284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Roll dice \u2192 Play skill cards \u2192 Defeat monsters \u2192 Earn rewards \u2192 Pay off your mortgage.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631830/extras/4327e8f252c22293762dbc2cbd7bfacc.poster.avif?t=1760349284\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631830/extras/4327e8f252c22293762dbc2cbd7bfacc.webm?t=1760349284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631830/extras/4327e8f252c22293762dbc2cbd7bfacc.mp4?t=1760349284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't a story about saving the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no final boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just one thing that never goes away\u2014your mortgage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no time pressure. Take your time and plan each move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With unpredictable dice rolls, quirky enemies, and diverse skill cards, luck plays a part\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but it\u2019s your judgment and strategy that will truly determine your success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631830/extras/28541e4e7056125fd86219e164b4ae07.poster.avif?t=1760349284\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631830/extras/28541e4e7056125fd86219e164b4ae07.webm?t=1760349284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631830/extras/28541e4e7056125fd86219e164b4ae07.mp4?t=1760349284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Highlights</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three unique cottages</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each offers a different set of skills and playstyle.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five ascension levels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock progressively harder challenges and test your strategic limits.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push yourself to see how far you can go\u2014no win condition, just survival.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Compendium</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and review the skill cards you've acquired as you fill out your collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based strategy gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time constraints\u2014plan each turn freely at your own pace.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep synergy between dice and cards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger surprising combo effects by matching dice rolls with card actions.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible resource management and adaptation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >React to changing situations and make the most of every die and card.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, rich in strategy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxed pacing, solid content\u2014great for casual players and strategy enthusiasts alike.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Skills Compendium Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3631830/121c82d8f854f810e7e19ad38bb4e890bd0bf454.jpg"},{"name":"Spirits Compendium Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3631830/310942114c444e85e8ba2a3f60d4bf9229e804aa.jpg"},{"name":"Beginner\u2019s Guide","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3631830/3a98bf3e7b54541f0043299984f759e26e79bae0.jpg"},{"name":"Very Sturdy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3631830/306e8a2d796e4470842eae4edaa98f6cef8d5782.jpg"},{"name":"Combo Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3631830/0117d00d292ac24b56e5888b6cd33c6cde3aaa38.jpg"},{"name":"Wealthy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3631830/9a0d41d81191c9c3b0e10cce10db37befba8c29f.jpg"},{"name":"Frozen Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3631830/a71c79a2469fb17e7e9f01c99cf4722817c9f0bb.jpg"},{"name":"Steady","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamst